<title>USA: Fluke names Katri president/COO.</title>
<headline>Fluke names Katri president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fluke Corp said Monday it had named David Katri to the post of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said he replaces George Winn, who is retiring. Winn will remain on the board.</p>
<p>Katri joined Fluke in 1975.</p>
